# Sources of the proprietary Broadcom TOD fingerprint driver
#
# This project never redistributes the driver (see docs/LICENSING.md).
# install.sh fetches it on your machine and verifies it against SHA256SUMS
# before laying it into the system. Two sources are pinned, in order:
#
#   1. Canonical's OEM deb  (PRIMARY)   the curated, hardware-verified build
#   2. Broadcom's upstream tarball (FALLBACK)  same version, a different build
#
# Both carry driver version 5.15.285-5.15.010.0. They are NOT byte-identical:
# Canonical rebuilds and packages the binary, and that OEM build is the one
# verified on real hardware, so it stays primary. The upstream tarball is used
# only when the OEM source cannot be downloaded.

# ── 1. Primary: Canonical OEM deb ───────────────────────────────────────────
